  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_1399.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Onda ha vivido este s&aacute;bado un preludio festivo de cara a la Fira, con el D&iacute;a de las Personas Mayores en el ermitorio del Salvador, la fiesta &#39;heavy&#39; de las chicas de la Penya Dispersats en el caf&eacute;-rock La Oveja Negra, y la actuaci&oacute;n del grupo rociero Sent&iacute;o en la Font de Dins, patrocinada por Les Tasques, L&#39;Entrep&agrave; y Desiguala-2. Todo en 232 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapersonesmajorsfestadispersatsovejanegrasentiofontdinsdissabte051013/img_0947.jpg\" alt=\"img_0947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapersonesmajorsfestadispersatsovejanegrasentiofontdinsdissabte051013/img_0948.jpg\" alt=\"img_0948\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapersonesmajorsfestadispersatsovejanegrasentiofontdinsdissabte051013/img_0949.jpg\" alt=\"img_0949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapersonesmajorsfestadispersatsovejanegrasentiofontdinsdissabte051013/img_0950.jpg\" alt=\"img_0950\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapersonesmajorsfestadispersatsovejanegrasentiofontdinsdissabte051013/img_0951.jpg\" alt=\"img_0951\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapersonesmajorsfestadispersatsovejanegrasentiofontdinsdissabte051013/img_0952.jpg\" alt=\"img_0952\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diapersonesmajorsfestadispersatsovejanegra